        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo PDL-100 Pocket Door Passage Set</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on sliding pocket doors, passage set (non-lockable).  Standard duty for use on 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" thick pocket doors. Has a built in flip out edge pull, to get the sliding door out of it's pocket. \r\n</p> \r\n<p>\r\nEasy to install. Packaged as a complete set with strike plate and all mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/pocket-door-privacy-lock-don-jo-pdl-101\">Pocket Door Privacy Lock</a>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-PDL-101_size.gif?v=1704442273\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo PDL-101 Pocket Door Lock size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo PDL-100 Pocket Door Passage Set\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height:  2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available in 7 different finishes.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PDL-100.pdf?v=1704262262\" target=\"new\">Don-Jo PDL-100 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
